OL,3,GNEWSAFather and son crowned Sheep Dog
OL,4,AWorld Trial champions
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first father and son to both be
OL,7,Fcrowned champions at the Sheep Dog
OL,8,FWorld Trial said they "never in million
OL,9,Fyears" thought they would win the
OL,10,Fdouble.
OL,12,FFarmer David Howells and his son, Jack,
OL,13,F19, from Cymmer, Neath Port Talbot,
OL,14,Ftravelled to the trials in Scotland
OL,15,Flast weekend.
OL,17,FDavid took the world title with his
OL,18,FBorder Collie dog, Wyverne Pip, in a
OL,19,Ffield of about 300 competitors from 34
OL,20,Fdifferent countries.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
